[{"answer":"Hello, Sandy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/1.mp3"},{"answer":"How have you been getting on with your dissertation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine, and I've been working hard on the various action points we agreed on our last tutorial.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you want to talk me through what you've done?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we agreed on three main targets for me to aim for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/6.mp3"},{"answer":"The first one was to find out about suitable data analysis software.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/8.mp3"},{"answer":"And what I decided to do was to look through catalogues specialising in IT.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/9.mp3"},{"answer":"That's a good idea.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/10.mp3"},{"answer":"What did you come up with?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I found the names of two promising ones.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/13.mp3"},{"answer":"But I also thought it'd be worthwhile talking to a lecturer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Who did you see?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Jane Prince. Do you know her?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/17.mp3"},{"answer":"She's in the Computer Centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, of course, she's the new Head.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. Well, she was very helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Did she suggest anything in particular?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. She recommended software called Vivat","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and said I should book up for a couple of practice sessions using Vivat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Great. I'm sure you'll find them useful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/25.mp3"},{"answer":"And, of course, the second target was to draw up a survey checklist...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, you emailed me it last week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you had a chance to look...?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/29.mp3"},{"answer":"um, I think it's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Very much on the right lines.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd say your first two sections are spot on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I wouldn't suggest that you change anything there, but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/33.mp3"},{"answer":"in section three you really do need to have questions on teaching experience.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah. I was thinking that section looked a bit short.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/36.mp3"},{"answer":"And my third target was, do further reading on discipline.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes. I mentioned a couple of writers, didn't I?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, well, I got hold of the Banerjee and I thought that was excellent.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/39.mp3"},{"answer":"But I'm afraid I didn't manage to get hold of the essays about classroom management,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/40.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, the ones by Simon Ericsson.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/41.mp3"},{"answer":"The bookshop said it was out of print and the library doesn't have a copy.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right, and I'm afraid I've lent my copy to another student.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/43.mp3"},{"answer":"What I suggest you do is try the library again -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/44.mp3"},{"answer":"this time apply for it through the service called special loans.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you done that before?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/46.mp3"},{"answer":"You're entitled to six books a year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/48.mp3"},{"answer":"No problem. That's what I'll do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/49.mp3"},{"answer":"So, lots of useful work done.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/50.mp3"},{"answer":"So, let's look at some new targets.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/51.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll start by having a chat about your Chapter One.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/52.mp3"},{"answer":"I very much enjoyed reading it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Your written style is very clear","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/54.mp3"},{"answer":"and you've included lots of interesting descriptions of education in your target area.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/55.mp3"},{"answer":"I've just got a couple of suggestions for some additional work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Could I just ask - what do you think I should call it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'd go for something like Context Review.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/59.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you think?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, short and to the point.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, as regards specific areas to work on,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/63.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd be quite interested to have a few more statistics about the schools in the different zones.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that wouldn't be a problem. I can get them from the Internet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Great,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/66.mp3"},{"answer":"and although you did make a reference to quite a few different writers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/67.mp3"},{"answer":"I think you should aim to cite more works written later than 2000.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/69.mp3"},{"answer":"That's more difficult, but I can try.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/70.mp3"},{"answer":"When do you want that done by?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, it's not urgent.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Um, I should aim for the end of term.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/73.mp3"},{"answer":"But in the meantime, I think you should also be thinking about Chapter Two.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Should I be drafting it already?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/75.mp3"},{"answer":"No, but I think you should note down its main sections.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/77.mp3"},{"answer":"You know, I always find that the hardest part.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/78.mp3"},{"answer":"I always find it helpful to put some ideas on index cards.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Um... and then you can sort them, and even lay them out on the floor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/80.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a real help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/81.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'll certainly try it!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/82.mp3"},{"answer":"When would the deadline be for that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/83.mp3"},{"answer":"My advice would be to get it done before you embark upon the research.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/84.mp3"},{"answer":"You can always change it later if you need to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/85.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. I'll get going on that...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-2-part-3-2023-08-02-09-32-57/86.mp3"}]
